    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa waenderera kugomba achiamba, “Chila mwisho wa mwaka wa sabaa mundaaswamehe osi ario na madeni genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivi ndivyo ndivyohenda: chila mmwenga yemuaphasa Muiziraeli myawe, naamswamehe ro deni, wala asimuise tsona kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu mwenye akatangaza madeni gaswamehewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaweza kuaisa ajeni, ela madeni gosi ga Aiziraeli ayawenu mundagaswamehe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Taphana hata mmwenga ndiyekala mchiya kahi yenu mana kpwenye yo tsi ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu anakuphani ikale yenu andakujaliyani sana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "napho mundamphundza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, kpwa kugbwira amurize nnazokuphani hivi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andakujaliyani dza vira arivyokulagani. Namwi mundagaaphasa mataifa manji, ela mwimwi tamundaaphaswa. Viratu vira mundatawala mataifa manji, ela mataifa higo tagandakutawalani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
