            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 25:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ichikala phandakala na mchiya kahi ya jamaazo, kpwenye mudzi mmwengawapho wa midzi iriyo kahi ya tsi muhewayo ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, msikale afu au achoyo kpwakpwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badalaye, mvugule mikono yenu na kumkopesha kpwa mendzwa chiasi cha kutosha mahitajige. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzimanyirireni sedze mkaaza mambo mai mwenu mioyoni, mukaamba, ‘Mwaka wa sabaa, mwaka wa kuswamehe adeni u phephi,’ na mkakosa kumlolato ndugu yenu mchiya na mkarema kumkopesha. Muchihenda hivyo, iye anaweza kumririra Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa sababu yenu na iyo indakala dambi kpwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apheni achiya moyo kutsuka bila kunungʼunika, mana kpwa ajili ya hiro, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andajaliya kazi zenu zosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 26:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 14:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 12:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiya taandaricha kukalapho kpwenye tsi; kpwa hivyo nakuamuruni, msikundzire mikono ndugu zenu ariotsowekpwa na achiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
