          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 13:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tenga kpwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo, ana osi a mwandzo alume a mifugoyo yani a ngʼombe na a mangʼondzi. Usiahendese ngʼombe hinyo kazi na mangʼondzi higo usiakate nyoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mwaka, uwe na atu a nyumbayo mundarya nyama hinyo mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, phatu Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphotsambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyama hiye achikala na chirema, akale ni chiwete au chipofu, au ana chirema chanjina chochosi, usimulavye kukala sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murye nyama iye kpwako mudzini. Atu osi ario swafi na ario najisi anaweza kumurya dza vira anavyorya chiphala au kulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
